{"agent":"bg38","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The change loads bug state twice without a common snapshot: `_unnamed` reads state at line 65, then `_linked` reads it again at line 66. If an open bug is fixed or invalidated between those two reads, `_unnamed` returns `[]` because the failing id already had an open bug, while `_linked` then returns `\"\"` because that bug is gone; the `if not bug and unnamed:` guard is false, so no replacement bug is filed even though the failing test now has no open bug. Concrete interleaving: open bug `B` names test `a`, current run has `ids=[a]`; process A executes `_unnamed` and sees `B` open -> `[]`; a second agent calls `ddflow bug fixed B`; process A then executes `_linked` and sees no open bug -> `\"\"`; no `_file` is made for `a`.","digest":"307685a0ff57a552","location":"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py:65-68","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py:65-68"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":4285,"diff_sha":"7ddb09e3eab8e96edb8fae22570d5a7f0156bf442a61e0d18af9bd7bc850702d","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":0.9,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"aaf165b9d61e4d60","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-baseline-red-filer-piles-up.rubber_duck.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261107T183559Z-9a3f89ef.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"63b2a6f824d951086295b5b2e73c2ccd58991ec5","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py":"100644 50643f2bf677329a6aeb0aa4ba179de62f85dc9e","tests/test_baseline_red_auto.py":"100644 67a270fce1800c6268196e91ef4c66c656d25b8b"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b8632","reviewer_families":["deepseek","g