{"agent":"bg38","data":{"by":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The change loads bug state twice without a common snapshot: `_unnamed` reads state at line 65, then `_linked` reads it again at line 66. If an open bug is fixed or invalidated between those two reads, `_unnamed` returns `[]` because the failing id already had an open bug, while `_linked` then returns `\"\"` because that bug is gone; the `if not bug and unnamed:` guard is false, so no replacement bug is filed even though the failing test now has no open bug. Concrete interleaving: open bug `B` names test `a`, current run has `ids=[a]`; process A executes `_unnamed` and sees `B` open -> `[]`; a second agent calls `ddflow bug fixed B`; process A then executes `_linked` and sees no open bug -> `\"\"`; no `_file` is made for `a`.","digest":"307685a0ff57a552","location":"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py:65-68","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py:65-68"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_findings":0,"delta_from":"63b2a6f824d951086295b5b2e73c2ccd58991ec5","delta_raised":[],"delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":2920,"diff_sha":"061e4d78bfd652bb38b8b1c81c1f2e1a24da902c554dd2c5d1dbe015187ee72d","diff_source":"delta review of 1 commit since 63b2a6f824","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":1.4,"family":"google","findings":1,"full_coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","output_digest":"60df82da2cadad4f","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-baseline-red-filer-piles-up.rubber_duck.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261107T184848Z-feacf765.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794076990.998247,"family":"moonshot","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"kimi-for-coding-highspeed","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"kimi-k3"}],"review_kind":"delta","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"1b095d4bf17282516720ebd74b480dec28ce0e8f","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/gate_baseline.py":"